{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Donna: The Canine Quest",
    "steam_appid": 2653120,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653120/extras/f81d9c90fe5d441d89446dcde4fd62d5.avif?t=1754875996\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a fantasy world where magical creatures and mythological beings coexist, an ancient evil begins to spread its shadow over the earth. Only the Rottweiler, known as Donna, possesses enough power and courage to face this darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653120/extras/52954490c6c00670a74b8d4dfa63a47e.poster.avif?t=1754875996\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653120/extras/52954490c6c00670a74b8d4dfa63a47e.webm?t=1754875996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653120/extras/52954490c6c00670a74b8d4dfa63a47e.mp4?t=1754875996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Donna, a brave canine warrior with a noble heart,</strong> has inherited from her ancestors the mission to protect the defenseless dogs and save Barkhaven from imminent destruction. With her trusty sword in one paw and her magical abilities, she embarks on an epic journey through enchanted forests, devastated lands and even hell itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653120/extras/cb7eec188b3fd3808e1d41de1313a8ab.poster.avif?t=1754875996\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653120/extras/cb7eec188b3fd3808e1d41de1313a8ab.webm?t=1754875996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653120/extras/cb7eec188b3fd3808e1d41de1313a8ab.mp4?t=1754875996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Villain: Rocco, the Hellbringer.</strong> The darkness spread across the world emanates from Rocco, a sinister Bull-Terrier who once lived among the Barkians but was corrupted by a thirst for power. Consumed by his ambition, Rocco sought out forbidden knowledge and, in his arrogance, opened a portal to the underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653120/extras/95c068290cb785d3e88a3604591840b8.poster.avif?t=1754875996\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653120/extras/95c068290cb785d3e88a3604591840b8.webm?t=1754875996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653120/extras/95c068290cb785d3e88a3604591840b8.mp4?t=1754875996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From this infernal gate, Rocco summoned malevolent creatures, bringing chaos and terror to Barkhaven. His once noble heart now twisted, Rocco commands an army of demonic creatures and dark entities, intent on destroying the city and ruling over the ashes. Now the fate of Barkhaven and the world is in Donna's paws.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653120/extras/f81d9c90fe5d441d89446dcde4fd62d5.avif?t=1754875996\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a fantasy world where magical creatures and mythological beings coexist, an ancient evil begins to spread its shadow over the earth. Only the Rottweiler, known as Donna, possesses enough power and courage to face this darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653120/extras/52954490c6c00670a74b8d4dfa63a47e.poster.avif?t=1754875996\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653120/extras/52954490c6c00670a74b8d4dfa63a47e.webm?t=1754875996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653120/extras/52954490c6c00670a74b8d4dfa63a47e.mp4?t=1754875996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Donna, a brave canine warrior with a noble heart,</strong> has inherited from her ancestors the mission to protect the defenseless dogs and save Barkhaven from imminent destruction. With her trusty sword in one paw and her magical abilities, she embarks on an epic journey through enchanted forests, devastated lands and even hell itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653120/extras/cb7eec188b3fd3808e1d41de1313a8ab.poster.avif?t=1754875996\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653120/extras/cb7eec188b3fd3808e1d41de1313a8ab.webm?t=1754875996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653120/extras/cb7eec188b3fd3808e1d41de1313a8ab.mp4?t=1754875996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Villain: Rocco, the Hellbringer.</strong> The darkness spread across the world emanates from Rocco, a sinister Bull-Terrier who once lived among the Barkians but was corrupted by a thirst for power. Consumed by his ambition, Rocco sought out forbidden knowledge and, in his arrogance, opened a portal to the underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653120/extras/95c068290cb785d3e88a3604591840b8.poster.avif?t=1754875996\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653120/extras/95c068290cb785d3e88a3604591840b8.webm?t=1754875996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653120/extras/95c068290cb785d3e88a3604591840b8.mp4?t=1754875996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From this infernal gate, Rocco summoned malevolent creatures, bringing chaos and terror to Barkhaven. His once noble heart now twisted, Rocco commands an army of demonic creatures and dark entities, intent on destroying the city and ruling over the ashes. Now the fate of Barkhaven and the world is in Donna's paws.</p>",
    "short_description": "Embark on a paw-some journey in Donna: The Canine Quest! Dive into a world of heroic hounds, where each thrilling battle and loot discovery keeps the excitement at its peak. With cute pixel-art graphics and satisfying gameplay this tail-wagging adventure will have you barking for more!",
